e these and then he talks  about the fourth C coaching a good  school system provides lots of  opportunities for mentoring and  communication between veterans and newer  teachers he says well that's that's  really good and that's something that I  think we should stress is important you  don't just like get your degree and do  your student teaching and then get  thrown into the classroom and boom now  you're doing great no education is  something that you need to work on over  time and it helps to draw upon other  people's experience and Reflections and  what worked and what didn't work and all  of that so there's you know quite a lot  of things that I do in fact like about  this work  there are a few things that I did find  problematic about this work none of  which I would say are like intrinsically  bad or anything or rise to the level of  you know misinforming the reader or  anything along those lines but there  were some things where I think you know  maybe there there could be a few  problems one is  it could have used a bit more editing  and you know I'm I'm hesitant to say too  much about this uh because it's easy to  get these things wrong but at one point  in the work Donald Roberts and here it  is on page 75 stoic author Donald  Roberson calls this emotional acceptance  you notice there's a t missing there and  it's actually there in the resources for  further study where Donald Roberts Sons  how to think like a Roman Emperor is uh  brought up so I don't know how that  crept in there you know is is that too  big of an issue no but but it does show  somebody should have probably copy  edited this maybe a little bit more than  they they did  There's also points where I think that  the  presentation of certain Concepts can be  a bit misleading and uh you know that  would be a problem it'd be the sort of  thing where somebody reads more and then  they're like wait a second I thought  that Iverson said XYZ but now I'm  finding out that this is actually the  ca